{"id": "De06aMuxN7y", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Kaikeyi LOVED Ram. So why did she send him away? 👑 The Two Boons | Ramayan Part 2 of 12\n\n🪔 King Dasharatha decided: tomorrow, Ram will be crowned prince. All Ayodhya lit up. But one maid, Manthara, watched from the terrace (Ayodhya Kanda 7).\n💚 She ran to queen Kaikeyi, and here's what most people don't know: Kaikeyi was OVERJOYED. She gave Manthara a jewel and said, \"I see no difference between Ram and Bharat!\"\n🐍 Manthara threw the jewel away. \"Wake up! Ram will banish your Bharat, or worse.\" (Ayodhya 8)\n⚔️ \"Remember the war? You saved the king's life against Shambara, and he gave you TWO BOONS. Use them now.\" (Ayodhya 9)\n😠 So Kaikeyi tore off her jewels and lay on the floor of the room of anger. The king found her there and swore by Ram himself to give her anything.\n👑 First boon: crown Bharat. 🌳 Second: send Ram to the forest, for 14 years. (Ayodhya 11)\n💔 Dasharatha fell. He begged her all night. She would not move.\n🌅 At dawn, Ram heard it, and his face did not change. \"Let it be. I will go.\" (Ayodhya 19)\n\n➡️ Part 3: the king remembers a curse from his youth, and it comes true. Follow @therishikatha so you don't miss it!\n\n📚 Rishi Katha picture books tell our gods' stories for kids, in simple words and bright pictures. Insta Family Sale on Books 1–3, till 25 Oct → rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n💬 Comment JAI SHRI RAM if you're watching the whole series 🙏\n🔖 Save this, and share it with someone who loves the Ramayan\n\n#ramayan #ramayana #kaikeyi #manthara #dasharatha #valmikiramayana #jaishriram #shriram #sanatandharma #hindumythology #indianmythology #ramayanseries #kidsbooks #rishikatha #mythologyforkids", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792736967, "like_count": 2846, "comment_count": 18, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1836697787481969a", "ext": 